1
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,900
That's the spirit!

2
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,300
You Japanese have to be greedy and stubborn!

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,650
We've come to help you, too.

4
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,300
You'd better be grateful!

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,600
You heard her!

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,350
We can't let the Japanese get all the glory!

7
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:24,050
We've come this far. Let us see this through with
you!

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,000
That can't be all you've got.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,400
Show us!

10
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,500
Show us Getter Robo's power!
